# Icons: Lucide Only

Use **only** [Lucide React](https://lucide.dev/) icons throughout the app. NEVER use emoticon or emoji icons (e.g. 👁️, 🙈, ✏️, ❌, ➕).

## Rules

- Import icons from `lucide-react`
- If a suitable Lucide icon doesn't exist, ask the user before using an alternative
- Unicode symbols like `×` for close buttons are acceptable as they are typographic, not emoji
- Never use emoji codepoints as icon replacements

## Example

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button>👁️</button>
<span>🗑️</span>

// ✅ GOOD
import { Eye, Trash2 } from 'lucide-react';
<button><Eye size={14} /></button>
<button><Trash2 size={14} /></button>
```
